      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "New Stroika regressiontest framework (really library/folder under Debug)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "THEN regtests need to use frameowrks.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "REASON SB framework is not used by any of foundation itself.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Ø  Package my existing ‘Test Framewoprk’ code into a Foundation module – maybe its own folder under foundation, or maybe a folder under debug (probably latter)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "o   Then refactor/use it in Stk test code.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Ø  REASON for this – to facilitate building ‘test stuff’ in places like WTF, or IPAM.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Ø  Consider experience with jest. But even crap I have right now for testing is OK. Just verifyIfTestREsult, and specif to level ‘test runner’ and maybe something to help with performance testing.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Ø  Expected (LAMNDA(), RESULT)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Ø  Expected (LMDBADA, LAMBDA_RESULT_VALIDATOR)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Ø  Expected (LAMBDA, EXCEPTION/TYPE OF EXCPETION)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Ø  Maybe rename Expected -> RunTest (TESTFUN, EXPECTEDFUN)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : " ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "OR maybeuse",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
